<title>SWITZERLAND: CYCLING-TOUR OF SWITZERLAND SIXTH STAGE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOUR OF SWITZERLAND SIXTH STAGE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BOSCO GURIN, Switzerland 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results</p>
<p>of the 147km sixth stage of the Tour of Switzerland from</p>
<p>Biascato to Bosco Gurin on Sunday:</p>
<p> 1. David Extebarria (Spain) three hours 55 minutes 56 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Leonardo Piepoli (Italy) 11 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Francesco Casagrande (Italy)     21</p>
<p> 4. Oskar Camenzind (Switzerland)    43</p>
<p> 5. Felix Carcia Casaa (Spain)     1:02</p>
<p> 6. Stefano Garzelli (Italy)	 1:06</p>
<p> 7. Peter Luttenberger (Austria)   1:09</p>
<p> 8. Philipp Buschor (Switzerland)  1:12</p>
<p> 9. Roland Meier (Switzerland)     1:55</p>
<p> 10. Felice Puttini (Switzerland)  same time</p>
<p> 11. Daniele Nardello (Italy)	2:03</p>
<p> 12. Bjarne Riis (Denmark)	   2:07</p>
<p> 13. Jan Ullrich (Germany)	   2:46</p>
<p> 14. Jens Heppner (Germany)	  2:58</p>
